      "description": "KIM KAPHWAN joins City of the Wolves today as part of Season 3! \n\nKIM KAPHWAN Voice Actors: June Yoon\nA legendary taekwondo fighter whose feats inspire Kim Dong Hwan and Kim Jae Hoon to this day. Though widely lauded as a master of his martial art, his drive never fades; indeed, even now he trains tirelessly in pursuit of greater strength. His justice-fueled kicks, undeniable and unforgiving, strike down evil without a moment's hesitation.\n\n💻Official Site \nhttps://www.snk-corp.co.jp/us/games/fatalfury-cotw/\n📶X\nhttps://x.com/FATALFURY_PR\n📶Instagram\nhttps://www.instagram.com/fatalfury_pr/\n📶TikTok\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@fatalfury_cotw\n\n©SNK CORPORATION ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. \n#FatalFury #餓狼伝説 #CotW #SNK",
